  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Level3EndingSequence
  story:
  - speaker: CHRONICLE
    text: Nallegam falls. For the first time in an age, the citadel answers with
      silence.
    readingSeconds: 4.5
  - speaker: CHRONICLE
    text: With all three ember relics recovered, the power he held over the island
      is finally broken.
    readingSeconds: 4.5
  - speaker: UPALUPAL
    text: These relics belong to our people. No throne will hold them again.
    readingSeconds: 4.5
  - speaker: CHRONICLE
    text: Beyond the citadel, the villages will kindle their fires again. What was
      lost can be rebuilt.
    readingSeconds: 4.5
  - speaker: UPALUPAL
    text: The battle is over. It is time to go home.
    readingSeconds: 4.5
